{
  "uid": "platform-overview",
  "title": "Platform overview",
  "description": "System overview: are the services up, and what is the HTTP rate, error rate, latency, and RabbitMQ backlog? Container CPU and memory are not on this board. cAdvisor is not in this Compose file.",
